 ],
 "literal": "Manual workers, to finish their work, / so that the fragrance of blossomed flowers fed on by bees is buried underneath, / even if left to wither on the long bunds, / without saying 'They are cruel, we shall move to another land and live there', / bloom again in the wet fields from which they were weeded out. / We are like the blue water-lilies of your town, O Lord! / Even if you do many unpleasant things to us, / because we are unable to live without you.",
 "translation": "To finish their work, manual laborers bury the fragrant, bee-frequented blossoms under the mud of the long bunds. Even when left there to wither, the blue water-lilies do not say, 'They are cruel, let us move to another land and live.' Instead, they bloom once again in the very fields from which they were weeded out. We are just like those water-lilies of your town, O Lord! Even if you do many unpleasant things to us, we are simply unable to live without you.",
 "modern": "கைவினைஞர்கள் தங்கள் வேலையை முடிப்பதற்காக, வண்டுகள் தேனுண்ணும் மலர்ந்த நெய்தல் மலர்களின் நறுமணம் மண்ணுக்குள் புதையுமாறு, நீண்ட வரம்புகளில் அவற்றைப் பிடுங்கிப் போட்டு வாடவிட்டாலும், 'இவர்கள் கொடியவர்கள், நாம் வேறு இடத்திற்குச் சென்று வாழ்வோம்' என்று எண்ணாமல், மீண்டும் தங்களை நீக்கிய அந்த வயல்களிலேயே பூக்கின்ற உமது ஊரின் நெய்தல் மலர்களைப் போன்றவர்கள் நாம், தலைவனே! நீ எங்களுக்குப் பல துன்பங்களைச் செய்தாலும், உன்னை விட்டுப் பிரிந்து எங்களால் வாழ முடியாது.",
 "explanation": "This poem is spoken by the heroine's friend to the hero who has returned from his visits to courtesans. She compares the heroine to the blue water-lilies (neytal) of the hero's own agricultural town (marutam landscape). The farmworkers weed out the water-lilies and bury them under the mud of the bunds to strengthen them, yet the flowers do not abandon the field; they bloom again in the very same soil. Similarly, despite the hero's neglect and cruel behavior, the heroine cannot think of leaving him or living without him. The image of the resilient neytal flower beautifully conveys the heroine's deep, unshakeable love and her inability to survive apart from her husband.",
 "model": "gemini-3.5-flash",
 "generated": "2026-11-26"
}